      "summary": "The area the manifest-builder/hypothesis-composition scope lands in: three route/hook pairs under frontend/app/src that each fold a CaseVersionNotValidError into the same generic load-error phase, and the sibling case-detail/cases-list hooks that already carry the three-way distinction they should reuse."
